# Encryption

## Commands
- `bitcoin.encrypt` - Encrypt selected text or entire document
- `bitcoin.decrypt` - Decrypt selected text or entire document

## Key Management
- Keys are generated using BSV's PrivateKey.fromRandom()
- Keys can be imported using WIF format
- Store keys securely - they are required for decryption
- Encrypted files are stored in the `.bitcoin/encrypted` directory

## Implementation Details
- Uses AES-256-CBC encryption
- IV is randomly generated and prepended to encrypted data
- Encryption key is derived from BSV private key
- Data is base64 encoded for storage